Test 3: constants in two separate banks (tests curBankP->constSymP per-bank tracking)
// If constSymP substitution was missed, constant emission in the second bank
// would use the wrong bank's symbol table and produce wrong addresses or silently
// drop the constants.
bank 0
100/
    lac [0777
    and [0377
    hlt
    constants

bank 1
200/
    lac [07777
    and [03777
    hlt
    constants

start 100
